# Thranduil's Company: "As long as you control another Elf, you may play an additional land on each of your turns" and "Landfall -
# Whenever a land you control enters, put two +1/+1 counters on target creature you control. It gains vigilance until end of turn."
# Bot1 controls the Company and a Llanowar Elves, another Elf. On turn 3 it plays a Swamp, a Plains - the extra land - and not a
# third land (refused). Each land triggers the landfall: the first puts two counters on the Elves (Bot2's Ornithopter is not a legal
# target, refused), a 3/3 with vigilance until the end of the turn; the second two on the Company, a 5/6. Vigilance is gone on turn 4.

